tor","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids shows October to November under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years. In 2025 on the county&rsquo;s middle value, February to March came in at 71% and September to October at 71%, while April to May, the wettest pair, ran 125%. Grid 15433 had its driest year in 1963 at 52%.</p>"}
